:: Photo Entrance
<<effects>><<set $location to "studio">>

You approach the photography studio, a tall old building opposite the hospital. 
<br><br>
There's a short flight of steps leading up to the door. The paint around the frame is chipped, but the brass knocker has been polished clean. A sign beside it reads, "Niki's photo studio. Models wanted."
<br><br>

<<getinicon>><<link [[노크한다|Photo Intro]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<nightingaleicon>><<link [[떠난다|Nightingale Street]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photo Intro
<<effects>><<set $location to "studio">>
<<set $photo_known to 2>>
<<set $photo to {}>>
<<set $photo.refused to 0>>
<<set $photo.audienceSize to 1>>
<<set $photo.timesWithThisAudienceSize to 0>>
<<npc Niki>><<person1>>

You lift the heavy knocker, and let it fall against the door. The sound carries through the building. You wait a minute, then reach to knock again, only for the door to swing open first. 
<br><br>
A young <<nnpc_gender "Niki">> stands there, a white stick poking out of <<his>> mouth. It's Niki.
<br><br>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"A-Are you looking for models?" you ask.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Excuse me," you say. "Are you looking for models?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I-I can model, if you still need someone," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"모델 구한다면서요." 당신은 말한다. "일거리 있어요?"
<<else>>
	"일자리를 찾고 있어요." 당신은 말한다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

니키가 문을 완전히 열어젖힌다. "들어와요."
<br><br>

<<set $nikiSeen.pushUnique("photo")>>

<<link [[들어간다|Photo Intro 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photo Intro 2
<<effects>>

니키를 따라 더 현대적인 실내로 들어간다. 계단을 지나 책상과 컴퓨터가 있는 방으로 들어간다. 니키는 그 뒤에 앉는다. 사진들이

<<if $settings.maleVictimChance gte 100>>
	남자
<<elseif $settings.maleVictimChance lte 0>>
	여자
<<else>>
	남자와 여자
<</if>>
<<him>> 뒤의 벽을 덮고 있다. 대부분 선정적이지만, 모두 품위가 있다. <<He>>【이가】 당신 뒤의 의자를 가리키자, 당신은 자리에 앉는다.
<br><br>

"스튜디오는 위층에 있어요." <<he>>【이가】 입에서 하얀 막대기를 빼서 쓰레기통에 휙 던지며 말한다. "사진 촬영은 최대 세 시간 걸려요. 선불로 지급하고요, 촬영 한 번에 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.round(450 * ((fameTotal() + Math.clamp($beauty / 3, 0, 3000)) / 3000))>></span>【을를】 받아요." <<He>>【이가】 <<him>> 뒤의 벽을 가리킨다. "이런 종류의 일을 하는 곳이에요."
<br><br>

<<He>> pulls a lollipop from <<his>> pocket, and sticks it in <<his>> mouth. The wrapper vanishes into a drawer already full of them. "One shoot a week. We can also connect you with clients for other work. Variable pay. What do you think?"
<br><br>

<<link [[수락한다|Photo Accept]]>><<npcincr Niki love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
<br>
<<link [[거절한다|Photo Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photo Accept
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"O-Okay," you say. "I need the money."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Thank you," you say. "I could use the money."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Okay," you say. "I'll do what you need."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"좋아요." 당신은 말한다. "돈이 좀 필요했거든요."
<<else>>
	"알겠습니다." 당신은 말한다. "돈이 필요하긴 해요."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Niki nods, already looking back to <<his>> screen. "Let me know when you're ready to start."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Photo]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photo Refuse
<<effects>>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"저-저는 남들이 쳐다보는 건 싫어서요." 당신은 말한다. "죄송합니다."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Thank you, but I don't think that's for me," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I-I'm sorry," you say. "I don't think I can."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"늙은 변태들이 저를 쳐다보는 건 싫어요." 당신은 말한다.
<<else>>
	"저한테는 안 맞는 것 같아요." 당신은 말한다. "죄송합니다."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Niki accepts the refusal without pushing. "You know where I am if you change your mind."
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Nightingale Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photo
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "studio">><<effects>>

