:: Photo Ask
<<effects>>


<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"D-Do you have any other work?" you ask.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Do you have any other work available?" you ask.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I can do something else, if you need me to," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Got anything else?" you ask. "Something that pays."
<<else>>
	"Have you got any other work?" you ask.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if !$photo.job>>
	<<set _work_available to true>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

   니키가 고개를 끄덕이더니, 한동안 <<his>> 화면을 더 쳐다본다.
   <br><br>
   "괴수 인형 탈을 쓰고 전단지를 나눠줄 사람을 찾는 업체가 있어요. 화려한 일은 아니지만, 전단지 한 장당  £1에 실적 보너스도 주죠. 금방 수입이 짭짤해질 테고,
   <<if $fame.model gte 200>>
       사람들 기억에도 남을 거예요."
   <<else>>
       "누구나 처음은 있는 법이니까요."
   <</if>>
