:: Photography Chef
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<if $photo_known is undefined>>
	<<set $photo_known to 1>>
<</if>>
<<npc Niki>><<person1>>샘이 알려준 주소로 다가간다. 병원 맞은편에 있는 오래된 건물이다. 노크하려고 손을 들었을 때 문이 활짝 열린다.

젊은 <<nnpc_gender "Niki">> 한 명이 서 있다. 입에는 하얀 막대기가 꽂혀 있다. <<He>>【은는】 당신을 빤히 쳐다보며 기다린다.
<br><br>

<<if !$nikiSeen.length>>
	<<speechresolve>>
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		"저, 사진사를 찾고 있는데요." 당신은 말한다. "샘이 여기 있다고 해서요."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Hello," you say. "Sam from the Ocean Breeze sent me."
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"Sam sent me," you say. "I'm here for the shoot."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"샘이 보냈어요." 당신은 말한다. "제가 바로 그 스타예요."
	<<else>>
		"샘이 보냈어요." 당신은 말한다. "오션 브리즈에서요."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	그 <<nnpc_gender "Niki">> 잠시 더 당신을 바라보더니, <<his>> 손을 내민다. "이름은 니키예요." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "스튜디오 준비됐어요." <<He>>【은는】 입에서 막대기를 빼서 길거리에 휙 던진다.
	<br><br>
<<elseif $nikiSeen.includes("farm")>>
	당신은 <<him>>【을를】 알아본다. 농장에서 봤던 사진사 니키다. 당신은 그 자리에 얼어붙는다. 니키는 당신을 빤히 쳐다보다가 입에서 막대기를 빼서 길거리에 휙 던진다. "스튜디오 준비됐어요." <<He>>【은는】 잠시 멈춘다. "무사해서 다행이네요."
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	사진사 니키다. <<He>>【은는】 당신을 바라본다. "인상착의가 익숙하다 싶었죠." <<He>>【은는】 입에서 막대기를 빼서 길거리에 휙 던진다. "스튜디오 준비됐어요."
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<set $nikiSeen.pushUnique("chef")>>

<<link [[다음|Photography Chef 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photography Chef 2
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>

내부는 더 현대적이다. 니키를 따라 계단을 올라가자, 흰색 스크린이 대부분을 차지하는 넓은 방으로 들어선다. 여러 개의 조명과 카메라 한 대가 기다리고 있다.
<br><br>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if $photo_known is 1>>
	"You done this before?" Niki asks, fiddling with the camera. <<He>> has another white stick in <<his>> mouth.
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		"N-No," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Not like this," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"No," you say. "But I'll follow your instructions."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"No," you say. "But I can handle a camera."
	<<else>>
		"No," you say.
	<</if>>
	<<He>> nods without looking at you. "Clothes are over there. Should be done in a few hours."
<<else>>
	"Were you told the details?" Niki asks, fiddling with the camera. <<He>> has another white stick in <<his>> mouth.
	<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
		"N-Not really," you say.
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
		"Only the basics," you say.
	<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
		"No," you say. "Tell me what to do."
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
		"Not enough," you say. "So start talking."
	<<else>>
		"No," you say.
	<</if>>
	<<He>> nods without looking at you. "Clothes are over there. Should be done in a few hours."
<</if>>
<br><br>

You walk behind a screen, and find a chef's apron and hat waiting on a stool. You put them on.<<headundress "photo">><<upperundress "photo">><<lowerundress "photo">><<headwear "chef hat" purple white>><<upperwear "chef jacket" white purple>><<lowerwear "slacks" white>>
<br><br>

<<link [[다음|Photography Chef 3]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Photography Chef 3
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>

카메라 앞에 선다. 니키가 <<his>> <<if $pronoun is "m">>수염<<else>>턱<</if>>【을를】 쓰다듬는다. "좋아요." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "샘이 요구사항 목록을 줬어요. 포즈 같은 것들요." <<He>>【은는】 입에서 막대기를 빼고, 주머니에서 막대사탕을 꺼내 대신 문다.
<br><br>

<<speechresolve>>
<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I'll try," you say, keeping your eyes on the lens.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I'll do my best," you say.
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"Tell me how you want me," you say.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
	"Try not to bore me," you say.
	<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
		"Or Sam."
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	"I'm ready," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

